-code-pools-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Manual code pools</span></h2><div class=\"ops-table-wrap con-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" data-bl-b=\"\"><table class=\"ops-table con-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Programme</span></th><th scope=\"col\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Available</span></th><th scope=\"col\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Issued</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">No codes uploaded.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"benefit-forms\" class=\"ops-section\" aria-labelledby=\"benefit-forms-heading\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Change a benefit\"><h2 id=\"benefit-forms-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Change a benefit</span></h2><form class=\"max-w-[40rem] border border-primary/20 p-6\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-title\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"form\" data-bl-label=\"Assign a ride benefit\" data-bl-form=\"\"><h3 id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-title\" class=\"text-xl\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Assign a ride benefit</span></h3><div class=\"mt-4 grid gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-guestId\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Guest id</span></label><input id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-guestId\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"guestId\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></div><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-householdId\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Household id</span></label><input id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-householdId\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"householdId\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></div><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-program\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Programme key</span></label><input id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-program\" type=\"text\" aria-describedby=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-program-help\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"program\" value=\"reception-ride-home\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><p id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-program-help\" class=\"mt-1 hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Lowercase letters, digits and dashes.</span></p></div><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-amountNote\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Amount (as text)</span></label><input id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-amountNote\" type=\"text\" aria-describedby=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-amountNote-help\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"amountNote\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><p id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-amountNote-help\" class=\"mt-1 hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From the planner (P-05). Shown to the guest verbatim.</span></p></div><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-validityNote\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Validity (as text)</span></label><input id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-validityNote\" type=\"text\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"validityNote\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></div><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-geofenceNote\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Area (as text)</span></label><input id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-geofenceNote\" type=\"text\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"geofenceNote\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></div><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-providerProgramRef\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Provider programme reference</span></label><input id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-providerProgramRef\" type=\"text\" aria-describedby=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-providerProgramRef-help\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"providerProgramRef\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><p id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-providerProgramRef-help\" class=\"mt-1 hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Uber voucher programme id, if any. Never a secret.</span></p></div><div><label class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2\" for=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-guestIsMinor\"><input id=\"_R_1siatpesnfknelb_-guestIsMinor\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"size-5\" name=\"guestIsMinor\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Guest is a minor (never eligible)</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-[var(--radius-button,2px)] bg-primary px-7 py-3 text-base text-neutral focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary disabled:opacity-60\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Assign</span></button></div></form><form class=\"max-w-[40rem] border border-primary/20 p-6\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_2siatpesnfknelb_-title\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"form\" data-bl-label=\"Revoke or reactivate\" data-bl-form=\"\"><h3 id=\"_R_2siatpesnfknelb_-title\" class=\"text-xl\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Revoke or reactivate</span></h3><div class=\"mt-4 grid gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_2siatpesnfknelb_-entitlementId\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Entitlement id</span></label><input id=\"_R_2siatpesnfknelb_-entitlementId\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"entitlementId\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></div><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_2siatpesnfknelb_-status\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Status</span></label><select id=\"_R_2siatpesnfknelb_-status\" name=\"status\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><option value=\"revoked\" selected=\"\">Revoked</option><option value=\"active\">Active</option></select></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-[var(--radius-button,2px)] bg-primary px-7 py-3 text-base text-neutral focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary disabled:opacity-60\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Apply</span></button></div></form><form class=\"max-w-[40rem] border border-primary/20 p-6\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_3siatpesnfknelb_-title\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"form\" data-bl-label=\"Upload manual ride codes\" data-bl-form=\"\"><h3 id=\"_R_3siatpesnfknelb_-title\" class=\"text-xl\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Upload manual ride codes</span></h3><div class=\"mt-4 grid gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_3siatpesnfknelb_-program\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Programme key</span></label><input id=\"_R_3siatpesnfknelb_-program\" type=\"text\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"program\" value=\"reception-ride-home\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></div><div><label class=\"block\" for=\"_R_3siatpesnfknelb_-codes\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Codes, one per line</span></label><textarea id=\"_R_3siatpesnfknelb_-codes\" name=\"codes\" required=\"\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"_R_3siatpesnfknelb_-codes-help\" class=\"w-full border border-primary/40 bg-neutral px-3 py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></textarea><p id=\"_R_3siatpesnfknelb_-codes-help\" class=\"mt-1 hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sealed at rest on save. Duplicates are ignored. The codes are never displayed again.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-[var(--radius-button,2px)] bg-primary px-7 py-3 text-base text-neutral focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary disabled:opacity-60\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Upload</span></button></div></form></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div>"
